Hi Andrea,

I was intending to bring the whole gokart. It's more fun to see the 
speedometer go up when you push down on the pedal and the regen to kick 
in when letting go etc. Everybody has seen hundreds of instrument 
cluster demos (at least when you work for the automotive industry). It 
might be a crowd catcher too (at least that's what I figured when I was 
at CES this year; a booth with a vehicle had many spectators :).

Please see early picture (without cluster) attached.

:rjs

